config DAC_INFINEON_HPPASS
	bool "Infineon HPPASS standalone DAC driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_INFINEON_HPPASS_DAC_V3_ENABLED
	depends on DT_HAS_INFINEON_HPPASS_ANALOG_V3_ENABLED
	select MFD
	help
	  Enable the standalone 12-bit DACs on MCPASS v3. Each device exposes
	  channel 0 for direct writes to its buffered pin output. These DACs
	  are independent of the 10-bit DACs in the HPPASS CSG block.
